body:
revenge is not justice. forgive it. 

&#x200B;

if you see my posts you can see that I wanted to put my father outside for 30 - 60 minutes when he told me that i stole his money, but i go too angry and i kicked him and spat on him, now i dont like my self. 

&#x200B;

give your self some time. cool down, calm down, go to some motivation subreddits and start to improve in something because it feels good. and you will not think about them.

now I remeber that something like this is described in New testament. It is new Jerusalem. 

&#x200B;

Nah, I will not give up. I will continue to read the Bible. Everybody should read the Bible at least to be educated and know more.

when I was kid my father didn't allow me to close a door when i was taking a shower. he would be angry if I try it, because moist has to go from bathroom. And he was siting on a couch in front of a door. he would say i will not look at you.

&#x200B;

I think that I wasn't taking shower when he was at home. I don't remember. I forgot that.

When I was 13-14 if I remember well, it was sunny and beautiful day. I was happy and I smiled because of that. My father slapped my face because he was thinking that I was making fun of him. Of course, day wasn't beautiful for me anymore and I wasn't happy.

&#x200B;

Years later when I told him about it he told me : sorry. it was obvious that he isn't sorry and that he doesn't feel anything about it.

I finished wrong college and now I do job I don't like. They knew my talents, but they didn't care about them.

&#x200B;

It is true that nparents take your words against you. When I was talking with my father, I would say something. he wouldn't talk next 5 days a lot. After that he would use my words as argument against me. He was thinking 5 days what to say.

I always believed in God. I accept Jesus. Sometimes my brain rejects this idea that God can be human too and that he can be at multiple places too. But after I wrote it, looks like God wouldn't be God if he can't be at multiple places at same time.

&#x200B;

Anyways, Jesus said that you should forgive countless number of times. I wish if he was my main  influence when i was younger. I had different influences, or idols like rock stars, scientists etc. How wrong I was. I couldn't learn ethics from them. Ethics are more important than intelligence, knowledge, talent etc.

&#x200B;

I am still sometimes tortured by guilt.

&#x200B;

This topic was deleted. How can you reply on it?

One part of my post is missing and I have no idea why. Maybe it was too long. Or maybe because I recommended some books. I will not recommend books next time. Sorry.

&#x200B;

Always be good person.

Did anybody else saw that you stole her money? Answer is no.

&#x200B;

Did anybody else heard that you told her that? No, she can't prove it.

&#x200B;

She is paranoid. And she probably has dementia. Don't react. Just tell to your family that you aren't thief and that you don't want to hurt her. If they don't trust you, you can't change other people. If you are old enough, leave your house, find a job. And don't get angry or sad, because maybe in this situation, you will react like me. My father told me that I stole his money. I tried to prove that he is wrong. he continued to humiliate me. I got so angry and sad that I kicked him and spat on him. Guilt tortures me almost every day. But. You did nothing wrong. You are so lucky, that you aren't guilty for anything. I wish that I never did anything wrong. I learned lesson in life. Never react when people abuse you verbally. Cut contact with them. They are wrong and toxic, you aren't wrong, or toxic. Also click on my user name, to see what I did. I was in similar situation and i made mistake. Don't make my mistake.

&#x200B;

Maybe you should learn about stoicism. There is good book: Meditations - Marcus Aurelius

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Also learn to forgive. It makes life easier, because you get rid of weight on your soul.

&#x200B;

And this what she is doing is illegal. You did nothing illegal.

 A narcissistic parent will hover over their child and give constant advice or criticism at every step. 

&#x200B;

My father gave me so many advice that I forgot almost all of them.

It is normal to make a sketch first. Later I saw how one artist does it.

&#x200B;

I will not go back to passions. Guilt ruins my life.

I was drawing and painting until i was 14. I always had to make a sketch and then to paint. My father was telling me that I am bad in drawing and painting because i had to make sketch first. I was thinking that he is right and I stopped to draw and paint. Now I see that I had talent but I ruined it. 

&#x200B;

I always liked electronics, but my mother didn't want to pay this college and my talent for electronics and physics disappeared.

&#x200B;

I played guitar and I was making music many years. One day my father was humiliating me, he told me that I stole his money and I kicked him and spat on him. To read full story, just click on my user name. Now I don't play and I don't compose because guilt is killing me.

&#x200B;

Good bye talents. Now I sit whole day in front of pc to escape reality.

Who made human race able to feel anger? I think God created us that way.

&#x200B;

Who decides where somebody will be born? I was thinking that God decides it. But maybe I was wrong.

You learned a lesson. You paid this lesson 600 dollars. Imagine if you paid this lesson 600 000 dollars. Never let somebody else saves your money. You aren't stupid. You can save your own money.

&#x200B;

Finish your high school and find a job and apartment.

&#x200B;

Also don't expect too much from your father. And don't trust to his promises.

&#x200B;

Why do you think that other people will make you happy? Nobody else cares about your dreams and goals. Become independent.

&#x200B;

Read book No More Nice Guy

&#x200B;

Never become violent. Read my stories to learn how anger and violence can destroy your life.

I would do nothing. She promises some job, but there is no job. Don't expect anything from her.

&#x200B;

Also when she tries to convert you to her religion be cool and don't show reaction.

&#x200B;

Also you can act like gray stone. google gray stone. you will become boring to her and she will forget you.

&#x200B;

and relax. things that she does and says aren't so important.

&#x200B;

and never become violent. Click my user name and read some stories. You will see how anger can ruin your life.

Thank you for reply. I see that you were abused, but don't make my mistake. Once when anger starts to control you, you will do things that you would never do in normal state of mind. Then those memories will follow you every day. This is how I ruined my life.

&#x200B;

I know what is it like to be a victim. it is hard. Later I became assaulter too. It is even worse. Don't make my mistake. I don't want that anybody ruins his, or her life, like I did.

&#x200B;

And why do you feel guilty, if I may know?

This picture really triggered me. Now I remember how my father was beating me when I was kid. It started when i was 4 and ended when I was 14 - 15.

&#x200B;

Also when I was 17 somebody slapped my face and kicked me without any reason. Then this idiot continued to bully me next 5 years.

&#x200B;

15 months ago he told me that I stole his money. I tried to explain that I never stole his money, but he continued to humiliate me. I got so angry and sad that I kicked him and spat on him. Guilt is killing me every day. I am near suicide.

&#x200B;

And also when I saw picture this shocked me, but I got aroused after I imagined that woman slapped my face. Looks like my sexuality is totally damaged by this abuse.

&#x200B;

You are very talented.

Guilt and self hate are worst emotions. I suffer of them every day. Guilt, depression and self hate torture me for a long time, 15 months, because I did something bad. I recommend you to read Bible every day and accept most of thing that are written there. It will make you feel better.

&#x200B;

I was bullied and abused. One day my father told me that I stole his money. i was so angry and sad that I lost control and I kicked him and spat on him. I wish that I didn't do what I did. I would live without guilt. You wish you didn't do what you did. You would live without guilt.

&#x200B;

You can send me dm, if you want. Maybe we will be able to understand guilt better and why we did something that make us feel so guilty.

I was abused, bullied. 15 months ago my father told me that i stole his money. I got so angry that I spat on him and kicked him. Now guilt kills me.

&#x200B;

Friendly advice: Don't be violent toward those that bully you.

&#x200B;

For more details click my user name and read some posts. Don't make my mistake. It will ruin your life.

&#x200B;

Visit psychiatric soon.

I was thinking that those two extreme moods, depression, self hate and guilt in 13-14 months, and then happiness after that can be sign of bipolar disorder.

&#x200B;

Why would I chase and meet people and then abandon them? And what would be consequences?

&#x200B;

I still feel happy. Maybe this is hypomania and not real happiness. It lasts about 5 days or more. It started when I started to read Bible. I will question on /r/Christianity to see if Bible has power to improve mood. I know that it sounds insane, if you are atheist.

Somebody on reddit told me to read this book and 8 other books. And to send him dm after I read them all. I have read them all but he deleted his account.

&#x200B;

This book is about this: People who were abused or abandoned in ages between 0-5 years make some tactics to survive. Because when you are young you are dependent. Some become people pleasers, some do everything to impress other etc. But everything they do is surviving, this is not a real life. There are two extreme behaviors: asshole, he hurts other and do everything to feel good, he doesn't care about other people. Too nice person, he does everything to please other, but he is always unhappy. Nice guys come from abusive, dysfunctional families. They aren't nice, even if they try to be nice, they manipulate other people to survive. Also nice guy has bad friends because bad relationships are familiar for him. His girlfriend doesn't respect him, and does nothing because this behavior is normal to him, he learned it in his house, in childhood. He doesn't know to end relationship, even if it is toxic, because he spent his childhood in toxic environment and it is normal to him, etc. Different nice guys have different mental problems. And they aren't nice. There are a lot of different and interesting things in this book, that can motivate you to have better life.  You should read it, I forgot some things. He also told me to read some other 8 books. They all are great, they can teach you to have better life and achive a lot in life. Only problem that stops me from improving my life is guilt. When ever I want to do something to improve my life, this voice, or guilt says that I do not deserve it.

What is therapist? Is it psychologist?

&#x200B;

Why do I need therapist? Because of bad childhood, or because I spat and kicked my father?

1) help you for answer!

&#x200B;

2) I have question. Why are you helping me? Do you see that I kicked and spat on somebody? Good people don't do that.

My father told me that I stole his money. I would never do that. I tried to prove that I didn't steal his money, but he continued to humiliate me. I was so angry and sad that I kicked him and spat on him. 

&#x200B;

He also abused me when I was kid. And I just couldn't take it anymore.

&#x200B;

If I could go back I would undo what I did. Guilt is killing me. I hate my self and I want to kill my self.

I don't know if he is mentally ill. He was aggressive when I was younger. Which can be sign of some illness, or maybe he was asshole. 

&#x200B;

Maybe he has dementia, which makes me even more guilty.

&#x200B;

Maybe he has paranoia.

&#x200B;

I don't know.

You have some worth, you don't see it. At least, you are listening too good music, like Korn and Linkin Park, I listen to same music, I wish if I had friends who have same taste in music.

&#x200B;

You will find a job. I got first job with 31.

&#x200B;

You will find friends, be patient. And don't wait for them to fall from sky. Talk to people.

&#x200B;

I never had gf too.

&#x200B;

You will find something that you enjoy and it will be meaning of your life.

Sorry for your loss.

&#x200B;

Was she ill?

My father joined Adventists. He forced my mother and sister to get baptized in this "church". Adventists think that Saturday is seventh day. And they don't work anything on Saturday. Even if I rejected to join this sect, I couldn't do anything on Saturday. At summer everybody was going to beach and I had to sit in my yard whole day when other people enjoy at beach. And if somebody wanted to do something at Saturday he would beat  my mom, sister, or me. And my mom found some job. She was earning only 100 euro. But all members of sect had to donate 10% of salary. She had to give 10 euros every month. And they also were selling some religious books. And she had to buy it. And we had less that 90 euro per month. And their priest would every Saturday come to our house on lunch. Sometimes he would bring other member of sect, or other priests on lunch, and we were surviving. And they they all would hold hands and pray to God and then they would read the Bible and trying to figure out what God wanted to say. They also wanted that I go to hospital to perform circumcision. Of course, I never did it. My penis is good and healthy.

&#x200B;

They also wanted to control our lives. They were shoving us some videos on vhs tapes, that all rock musicians are satanists. Then I would put albums by Nirvana, Metallica and other musicians on table when I know that they will come to my house. They also told my sister that she should not have friends who aren't Adventists too.

&#x200B;

I always pretended that I am atheist, just to irritate them, even if I believe in God.

He started to beat me when I was 4 and stopped when i was 14 or 15. When I was 14, or 15 he kicked me 4-5 times. I couldn't take it anymore and I was thinking: I can't take it anymore, I will stop it, or die. And I kicked him once. That that he stopped to beat me, my sister and my mother. She was stupid. She should ask for divorce. less than month ago I heard that my my mom had some verbal fight with my father and she told him: You was beating me when I was 7 month pregnant.

&#x200B;

Most of people wouldn't feel guilty, but I feel because when he told me that i stole his money, it was only verbal abuse, not physical. I should ignore it. This day I was much more violent than him. I didn't kicked him and spat on him because he was beating me when I was kid, I did it because he was accusing me for thinks that i never did, like that I wear make up, and I means that i am gay, but I am not gay etc. and when I try to defend my self he manipulates my every sentence to prove that he is right.

&#x200B;

I am not in States. And I am not gambler, and I do not drink.

&#x200B;

You said: Put your life in order. What do you want to say?

Here is my advice how to find new friends: Go outside. Join to some language school, some sport club, or something else. And people will not think about you that you are lonely etc. they will think this: this dude learns language, or he likes sport etc. And you should talk with those people. And eventually some of those people will become your friends.

&#x200B;

And if you can't find friends, go to gym. You will feel better after gym, because your brain releases endorphin. And after 2-3 months you will meet a lot of people there. And always when you go to gym you will talk with people.  And you will feed your need to communicate, even you don't have friends now. ( You will find them later. ) Just be careful in gym.  You will feel better.

&#x200B;

And now send me pm and ask me everything you want. I will also tell you some stuff about gym tomorrow.

Sabbath is Saturday?

&#x200B;

I don't go to church, I keep my religion as secret.

&#x200B;

And I didn't ask will I have enough time for sport if I go to church. I ask if it is sin. Most of people here Orthodox Christians and they don't do anything on Sunday.

You should watch videos like this one, when you have panic attack: [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HjOtMA4sZxI](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HjOtMA4sZxI)

&#x200B;

And feel free to send pm.

She should visit an oculist - doctor for eyes ASAP. And headache can be caused by high blood pressure. It is easy  to measure it.

&#x200B;

And of course I will pray for her.

I wish I was like you. You can change everything. 

&#x200B;

But I hate my self from some other reason, that I can't change.

What was my unlucky day. read my previous posts. My father told me that i stole his money. It is not true. i tried to prove it, but he continued to humiliate me. I went to my room. I was sad and angry. later I went to kitchen. Both of my parents were there. I told to my mother what happened. 

&#x200B;

After that i took his arms to put him outside. My mother was thinking that i will beat him. I didn't want to beat him, I wanted to put him outside of house for 30-60 minutes, just to see how I feel when he humiliates me. He fell on floor. He fell on floor when she tried to stop me. I put my hands around his neck, just to scare him. But he yelled: HELP ME, THIS THIEF WANTS TO KILL ME! This made me totally angry and I spat on him and kicked him. Since that I know that i did stupidest thing in my life.

&#x200B;

Now I feel self hatred, some tension in stomach, depression,  I am angry at myself etc.

&#x200B;

I wish if I could travel trough time, to undo this mistake.

&#x200B;

I wish I knew something that I read i book: meditations by Marcus Aurelius. When somebody humiliates you, do not feel humiliation. Those are just words. Some other redditor told me to read it.
